  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Paralyzing Gaze — Cursed Technique Reversal</em></p><p>You have gained the ability to reverse your technique, making your technique quicken instead of slow. As an action for 4 CE, you can choose a target that you can see within 30 ft. The target doubles their movement, gains a bonus to their AC equal to your CE modifier and gains an additional bonus action on their turn. At the start of your turn, you can spend 2 CE as a bonus action to maintain the technique. This effect ends if line of sight is broken.</p>",
